# Minimal fixture with a UV seam: v-index 2 is referenced with two different
# vt indices across its two incident faces (2 and 5), simulating a mesh
# exported with a UV chart boundary running through this vertex.
v 0.0 0.0 0.0
v 1.0 0.0 0.0
v 0.0 1.0 0.0
v 1.0 1.0 0.0

vt 0.0 0.0
vt 1.0 0.0
vt 0.0 1.0
vt 1.0 1.0
vt 5.0 5.0

f 1/1 2/2 3/3
f 2/5 4/4 3/3
